data error_type_fabricated_as_a_type_by_total_accessors: RecurringFailureMode = RecurringFailureMode {
  identity: "error_type_fabricated_as_a_type_by_total_accessors" as NonEmptyStr,

  receipts: [
    "INVALID STATE: a type node with name empty and no ident_span, answered where the node's inferred slot holds no type. v1.compiler.infer_types resolved_type (and child_type_node over it) is total: every state of the slot that is not Resolved (an unbound TypeVariable, a carried CompilerError, a Divergent, an uninferred child) reads as the nameless error_type node, so an error masquerades as a type (DESIGN section 5).",

    "MEASUREMENT (2026-10-17, work item adhoc-6584a70b-cf3, PR #14152 lane): 228,669 nameless type leaves over the self-host corpus, every one name empty, ident_span none. The kernel container builders cannot produce them. The producer is resolved_type's fallback arm. Callers at base 91af1d0e04: resolved_type 79 in 04_infer, 72 in 05_emit_rust, 18 in 05_emit, 6 in 05_emit_python, 5 in 05_emit_go, 3 in 05_emit_core_support, 2 in 04_resolve, 2 in 04_types, 1 each in 04_access and 04_emit_info. child_type_node has 101 call sites (31 in 04_infer, 27 in 04_types, 22 in 05_emit_rust, 6 in 05_emit, 5 in 04_emit_info, 3 each in 04_patterns, 04_lookup, 04_resolve, 1 in 04_items).",

    "PER-SITE TABLE for the 31 child_type_node sites in 04_infer.dag: PR #14312 issue comment 6241958544 (unsettled 10, refuse 14, name readers 7, classified from call shape and not yet confirmed site by site).",

    "LANDED: S4 (#14221) and the verdict site, S1a (PR #14312): type_resolution_verdict reads a child's inferred slot directly, so an unbound or carried-error child is UnderResolved and a Divergent child is DivergentExpression, where the fabricated node verdicted FullyResolved. Executed mutation flips 3 of 4 controls.",

    "MEASURED NOT TO DEPEND ON THIS: gentle-carp-16's #14152 probe over 254 rows (about 10,176 printed nodes) found no node with inferred CompilerError on the compared path, and 50 rows carrying TypeVariables, which their fold already treats as unsettled. The earlier claim of 7 Unit fabrications in substitute_generics_apply was struck: that function is byte-identical on main and returns the node on Absent. So the remaining migration is not a dependency of #14152.",

    "UNATTRIBUTED: Product(Unit<>) appears in the bound side of 35 of those rows and the actual side of 1. It is passed into the fold from upstream typing, not fabricated at substitution, and its producer is not identified (rows in gentle-carp-16's scratch branch scratch/rebind-census).",

    "RUNG FOUND AT: below the ladder on the type-read path (a total accessor fabricates a plausible value). CEILING: 4, since a typed read of the slot has no constructor for the fabricated node once error_type is deleted as a value. NOT SCHEDULED: v1 is under the purpose test (gunbc.v1.v1_maintenance_standing), and with #14152 shown not to depend on the migration it does not serve the v2 self-host program today. NEXT-RUNG TRIGGER, NAMING THE CAPABILITY: a consumer is shown to read a fabricated error_type as a type, at which point the remaining slices (child_type_node and resolved_type callers moved onto a direct match of the inferred slot, then error_type and the resolved_type delegate deleted) are admitted in that order.",
  ],

  evidence: [],
